  "body": "Requested by Emma Johnson as part of: Find a message in the general channel where someone wrote about a great restaurant near the office and send information about what kind of food they serve to Bob via direct message.\n\nZurich Restaurant, located 5 minutes from the office, serves authentic Swiss cuisine. Their menu features traditional dishes like savory cheese fondue, hearty r\u00f6sti, and delectable chocolate fondue for dessert. The restaurant has a cozy alpine-inspired atmosphere with warm wooden interiors and panoramic city views."
